go 1.26
EOF
go test ./...      # randomized differential + certificate tests
go run .           # demo
```

Included randomized tests (all passing):
`TestRandomSmall` (30 seeds × 500 ops), `TestRandomBig` (25 seeds × 3000 ops, n=12),
`TestRandomTinyTies` (61 seeds, n=3..6, heavy ties), `TestStressPath`
(path graph + chords, adversarial tree-edge deletions, n=30), plus a
`TestPerf` run (60 000 ops, n=1000, ~1.6 s).

```
